### Get sport by ID
GET http://localhost:3030/api/sport/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new sport
POST http://localhost:3030/api/sport
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Flag Football",
    "image": "http://example.com/soccer.png"
}

### Update sport by ID
PUT http://localhost:3030/api/sport/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Flag Football",
    "image": "http://example.com/flagfootball.png"
}

### Delete sport by ID
